WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:10.022
Mom brought something home.

2
00:00:10.023 --> 00:00:16.219
Do you want to know what it was?

3
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.968
Mom: Hana and Bada!

4
00:00:17.969 --> 00:00:20.199
Look what I have.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.567
Bada: What's up, Mom?

6
00:00:22.568 --> 00:00:24.336
What is it?

7
00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:26.213
Mom: It is a scale.

8
00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:30.651
It shows you how much you weigh.

9
00:00:30.652 --> 00:00:33.190
Bada: How much do I weigh?

10
00:00:33.191 --> 00:00:36.628
Mom: Hold still. Let me see.

11
00:00:36.629 --> 00:00:43.920
Bada weighs 22 kilograms.

12
00:00:43.921 --> 00:00:45.915
Bada: Is that heavy?

13
00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:47.576
Mom: It's about right.

14
00:00:47.577 --> 00:00:49.993
But you need to eat more.

15
00:00:49.994 --> 00:00:52.609
Mom: Now it's Hana's turn.

16
00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:56.498
Hana: I will do that later.

17
00:00:56.499 --> 00:00:58.819
Bada: Oh, come on, Hana.

18
00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.984
I want to see how much you weigh.

19
00:01:01.985 --> 00:01:05.879
Hana: All right. I will do it then.

20
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.513
Bada: How much do you weigh?

21
00:01:09.514 --> 00:01:12.802
Mom: Hana weighs 28 kilograms.

22
00:01:12.803 --> 00:01:17.351
Bada: Wow! Hana, you weigh so much.

23
00:01:17.352 --> 00:01:21.557
Hana: No, I don't!

24
00:01:21.558 --> 00:01:23.960
I don't think I'm heavy.

25
00:01:23.961 --> 00:01:25.931
What do you think?

26
00:01:25.932 --> 00:01:29.113
How much do you weigh?
